  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e27e97d2d292df747a20292f27578741, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _itemName: 'Journal Entry: Day 0'
  _additionalText: "Journal Entry:\n\nDay... I dunno. Let\u2019s call it Day Zero.\r\n\r\nThe
    Geiger counter\u2019s been screaming ever since I got within a mile of this place.
    Something\u2019s alive in here, or...was, and whatever it is, it\u2019s emitting
    enough radiation to grill a steak.\r\n\r\nI told myself I came to figure out
    what happened. To get answers. But maybe that\u2019s a lie. Maybe I just wanted
    to feel something again. The silence, the static, the rot \u2014 it\u2019s loud
    here. And that weird part of me? The part that never learned to quit? It won\u2019t
    let go.\r\n\r\nIf someone\u2019s reading this... well, I guess that means I made
    it in. Probably still alive. Probably not glowing...yet. \r\n\r\nKeep your eyes
    open. People left clues all over \u2014 scribbled notes, half-burnt logs, whatever
    they could manage before they went under.\n \nRead. Everything.\n \nPiecing it
    together might be the only way out of here. Or at least, the only way to understand
    what this place is doing to people.\r\n\r\nTime to move. I can feel the buzz
    crawling under my skin again. Like something\u2019s watching. Like the place
    knows I\u2019m here.\r\n\r\n- Vera"
  _readIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 48e794a48349b694a9236f793cd9d68c, type: 3}
